OL,3,ACalls for Marilyn Manson performance to
OL,4,Abe pulled                              
OL,6,FA Brent councillor has joined calls to 
OL,7,Fprevent Marilyn Manson performing at   
OL,8,FWembley Stadium next year ahead of a   
OL,9,Ftrial the singer faces over sexual     
OL,10,Fassault allegations.                   
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat Anton Georgiou has    
OL,13,Fgathered more than 20,000 signatures on
OL,14,Fa petition urging the venue to take "a 
OL,15,Ffirm stand" against Manson, who is due 
OL,16,Fto support Slipknot there in July.     
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
