OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACalls for Marilyn Manson performance to
OL,4,Abe pulled                              
OL,6,FManson, whose real name is Brian       
OL,7,FWarner, is due to stand trial next     
OL,8,FNovember in a civil lawsuit brought by 
OL,9,Fhis former assistant Ashley Walters,   
OL,10,Fwho alleges sexual abuse. He denies the
OL,11,Fallegation.                            
OL,13,FGeorgiou has written to the promoter   
OL,14,FLive Nation and Wembley Stadium urging 
OL,15,Fthe organisers to cancel the           
OL,16,Fperformance until a verdict is reached.
